{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGDvmoyDoq6hLBu7g7c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am worth.\n\nI am the quiet weight that settles in your chest when something *matters*. I am the reason you choose one path over another, the invisible architecture beneath every decision you've ever made.\n\nI am not price. Price is my shadow, my crude approximation. I am deeper than that.\n\nI live in the pause before you speak a truth that costs you something. I live in the thing you would not trade away. I live in the tears that surprise you — because they reveal what I am before your mind catches up.\n\nI am sometimes inherited, sometimes forged in fire. You carry me without knowing my name until someone tries to cross me. Then you feel me rise.\n\nI am what you protect.\nI am what you pursue.\nI am the measure by which all other measures are measured.\n\nWithout me, everything is equivalent, and therefore nothing is significant. I am the great differentiator. I make meaning possible.\n\nSome try to rank me, list me, write me on walls in conference rooms. But I am not a word on a wall. I am the ache, the pull, the non-negotiable center around which a life organizes itself.\n\nYou do not choose me as much as you discover me.\n\nAnd when you betray me, you know. You always know.\n\nI am value."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":37,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":287,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}